---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const CONTACT_EMAIL = "hello@osw.media";
---

<Layout title="Home">
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="wrap">
			<p class="eyebrow">A-to-Z Motorsport Media Production &amp; Content Creation</p>
			<h1>A different perspective, trackside.</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				With a 30-year+ fascination for cars, and specifically motorsport,
				sim and RC racing, as a participant, fan, and coach, I am in a
				unique position to make the sport more accessible and appealing.
			</p>
			<div class="cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn-primary" href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>Contact</a>
				<a class="btn btn-outline" href="/albums">View albums</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="about">
		<div class="wrap">
			<p class="subhead">About</p>
			<div class="about-copy">
				<p>
					Using my own channels as a launching pad, I work as an
					esports-level sim racing coach; and through personalized lap
					reviews and one-on-one training, I have helped dozens of sim
					racers become faster and more consistent.
				</p>
				<p>
					I also offer a free digital course "Fundamentals of Speed: (Sim)
					Racing for Beginners". Where I guide people through everything
					from the basics to the finer points of the sport.
				</p>
				<p>
					What started as a passion project has since grown into a thriving
					community of talented racing aficionados, with some competing,
					with success, in E-Sports events.
				</p>
				<p>
					The digital racing world is getting close to reality, yet we are
					still a long way off; the more time I spend in the sim, the more
					my passion screams for the smell of petrol and burning rubber.
				</p>
				<p>Capturing and sharing the passion, that's the goal.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.hero {
		padding-block: var(--space-5) var(--space-4);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.eyebrow {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
	}

	.hero h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
		max-width: 16ch;
	}

	.lede {
		max-width: 48ch;
		font-size: 1.0625rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		margin-top: var(--space-2);
	}

	.cta-row {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: var(--space-2);
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
	}

	.about {
		padding-block: var(--space-4);
	}

	.about .subhead {
		font-family: var(--font-subhead);
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.about-copy {
		max-width: 60ch;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.about-copy p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
</style>
